 "remarks": "Rare opportunity to own one of the premier combined penthouse residences at the prestigious Park Tower. Spanning over 2,000 sq. ft. of sophisticated living space, Penthouse 28EF is a stunning sun-drenched two-bedroom, two-and-a-half-bath sanctuary offering sweeping panoramic views of the city skyline and Long Island Sound through expansive floor-to-ceiling windows.  Step into a gracious entry foyer featuring custom marble-inlaid tile, flowing seamlessly into a vast open-concept living and dining area. The chef's kitchen is appointed with white cabinetry, granite countertops, a center island with seating, and stainless steel appliances. The thoughtful layout includes a private outdoor balcony, a dedicated home office, and an expansive primary suite complete with a custom walk-in closet and a spa-inspired en-suite bath.  Residents enjoy world-class building amenities including 24-hour security, full concierge service, a year-round indoor pool, a fully equipped fitness center, resident lounge, and a stunning rooftop deck with panoramic views. For ultimate commuting ease, the building provides a private weekday shuttle service directly to the Stamford train station. Perfectly situated just steps from Stamford's premier dining, shopping, and Metro-North, offering the absolute peak of luxury and convenience.",
